,["ARC or PLC in Harper County","/arc-plc/oklahoma/harper-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 43 of the 75 years from 1951 to 2025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids in Harper County. In 2026 so far, March to April sits at 15% of normal and April to May at 37% on the middle. A year earlier it swung the other way, with August to September at 201% of normal in 2025 on the middle.</p>"}
